        },
        {
          "text": "Ibisigaye, mbīkiwe igitsibo c’ukugororoka, ico Umwami wacu, umucamanza agororotse, azompa kuri wa musi, kandi si jewe jenyene nzogihabga, ariko kandi n’abakunze kuzoseruka kwiwe bose bazogihabga.",
          "type": "text",
