              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arik’ Umwami wacu ni we yampagarikiye, arandemesha, kugira ng’ ubutumwa buvugwe nanje butagabanije, abanyamahanga bose babgumve. Nuko mva mu menyo y’intambge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
