              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umwami wacu azonkiza ibibi vyose bangirira, azondokora kugira ngw anjane mu bgami bgiwe bgo mw ijuru. Icubahiro kibe iciwe, ibihe bitazoshira. Amen.",
          "type": "text",
